CM_ "Evidence tags: CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2 is observed in the eight repository captures; RELATED_ACCORD_DBC is inherited from another Accord variant; INHERITED_FROM_NIDEC_1FA is positional only; GUESS is correlation-derived and unverified; UNRESOLVED has no assigned semantics.";
CM_ BO_ 57 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 2; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ BO_ 151 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 8; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ BO_ 228 "v3 note: OP steering TX (not on sampled non-lateral drives)";
CM_ BO_ 314 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 8; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ SG_ 316 CAR_GAS "Should exist on Nidec";
CM_ BO_ 319 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 8; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ BO_ 346 "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: cyclic DLC 8 with valid Honda checksum/counter. RELATED_ACCORD_DBC supplies the STEER_STATUS_1 name; payload signals remain unresolved.";
CM_ BO_ 398 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 3; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ SG_ 420 BRAKE_HOLD_RELATED "On when Brake Hold engaged";
CM_ BO_ 426 "UNRESOLVED cyclic broadcast, DLC 8; Honda checksum and counter confirmed from CU2.";
CM_ BO_ 427 "v3 note: not seen on sample, verify";
CM_ BO_ 476 "GUESS: best match vEgo_kph corr 0.58; scale is a fit, verify.";
CM_ BO_ 448 "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: seven-byte 50 Hz brake-command-family message. D4-D6 are zero in all repository captures. Layout matches the first fields of Nidec 0x1FA; TX behavior is not validated.";
CM_ SG_ 448 COMPUTER_BRAKE "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: 10-bit command magnitude; observed 0-128. Technical field range is 0-1023; no CU2 TX safety limit is established.";
CM_ SG_ 448 BRAKE_PUMP_REQUEST "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2 with high confidence from timing and the related Accord decoder.";
CM_ SG_ 448 D2_STATE_FLAGS "UNRESOLVED D2 bits 5:1. Do not inherit hybrid or CMBS meanings without CU2 evidence.";
CM_ SG_ 448 COMPUTER_BRAKE_REQUEST "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2 with high confidence; remains active about 0.48 s after the braking marker.";
CM_ SG_ 448 D3_STATE_FLAGS "UNRESOLVED D3 bits 7:1. D3.b4 tracks ACC state; other semantic names are not established.";
CM_ SG_ 448 RESERVED_ZERO_D4_D6 "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: always zero in all eight captures; related 0x1FA AEB/FCW/chime meanings are not claimed.";
CM_ BO_ 487 "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: DLC 4 at 50 Hz; two raw 10-bit pressure channels, checksum, and counter. Signal scaling is intentionally uncalibrated.";
CM_ SG_ 487 BRAKE_PRESSURE1_RAW "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2 raw channel. The upstream Nidec scale/offset produces implausible CU2 values and is not applied.";
CM_ SG_ 487 BRAKE_PRESSURE2_RAW "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2 raw channel. The upstream Nidec scale/offset produces implausible CU2 values and is not applied.";
CM_ SG_ 490 LONG_ACCEL "wheel speed derivative, noisy and zero snapping";
CM_ BO_ 773 "CONFIRMED_FROM_CU2: short DLC 2 variant. The related Honda DLC 7 seatbelt signal layout does not apply; STATUS_RAW semantics are unresolved.";
CM_ BO_ 780 "ACC_HUD, 10Hz, from radar/ACC unit. Same Honda checksum/counter as 506 (verified 100.0000% on 64880 stock frames). Stock never sets ACC_PROBLEM/FCM_*; those appear only when openpilot is active (7.2% duty on 84-8b).";
CM_ SG_ 780 PCM_SPEED "ACC target speed, 0.01 kph. =0 at standstill (84% of zero-speed frames). v3 max [0|250] was wrong (16-bit*0.01 -> 655.35).";
CM_ SG_ 780 PCM_GAS "ACC powertrain gas/torque request. Dominant idle value ~198; varies with ACC accel demand. v3 max [0|127] wrong (8-bit -> 255).";
CM_ SG_ 780 CRUISE_SPEED "Set speed in kph; 255 = no set speed (ACC not engaged). 255 in 53% of stock frames.";
CM_ SG_ 780 ENABLE_MINI_CAR "= ACC engaged. P(set|cruiseState.enabled)=1.00, P(set|!enabled)=0.001. Shows host car on HUD.";
